    "name": "The tree of immortality",
    "steam_appid": 2649490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649490/extras/fec37243e25d0359e359d100af20d4bc.avif?t=1722544781\" width=600 height=174 /></span><br><br>Awaken as a humble  farmer, lost and bewildered in a dense dark forest, before a giant tree. within the darkness are sinister spirit beasts that emerge from the shadows, threatening your survival. Battle these monsters, gain experience, explore and grow stronger before the next wave starts.<br><br>Death is not the end. Each time you die, you awaken once more within an unknown forrest at the base of the mysterious tree, your memories clouded, but your resolve unshaken. As waves grow stronger and the creatures become more formidable, uncover the secrets of the tree and your immortal existence within this forrest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649490/extras/43d5112c74c44605990dfcfe9816f7a9.avif?t=1722544781\" width=600 height=174 /></span><br><br>In this game you will play as a cultivator who finds himself in a large forest infront of a giant tree. where you will have to scavenge for wood, stone and other supplies to craft new weapons and supplies. During the waves; spirit beasts will come to attack you. Level up, increase your stats, learn new abilities and unlock stronger weapons to use in your survival. Unlock the lore behind the tree and try to fight your way through the hordes of enemies untill you break this cycle of immortality.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649490/extras/fec37243e25d0359e359d100af20d4bc.avif?t=1722544781\" width=600 height=174 /></span><br><br>Awaken as a humble  farmer, lost and bewildered in a dense dark forest, before a giant tree. within the darkness are sinister spirit beasts that emerge from the shadows, threatening your survival. Battle these monsters, gain experience, explore and grow stronger before the next wave starts.<br><br>Death is not the end. Each time you die, you awaken once more within an unknown forrest at the base of the mysterious tree, your memories clouded, but your resolve unshaken. As waves grow stronger and the creatures become more formidable, uncover the secrets of the tree and your immortal existence within this forrest.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2649490/extras/43d5112c74c44605990dfcfe9816f7a9.avif?t=1722544781\" width=600 height=174 /></span><br><br>In this game you will play as a cultivator who finds himself in a large forest infront of a giant tree. where you will have to scavenge for wood, stone and other supplies to craft new weapons and supplies. During the waves; spirit beasts will come to attack you. Level up, increase your stats, learn new abilities and unlock stronger weapons to use in your survival. Unlock the lore behind the tree and try to fight your way through the hordes of enemies untill you break this cycle of immortality.",
